    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455920/extras/5966f7ddcf3d60c17b0159458c1e6a54.poster.avif?t=1733135420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455920/extras/5966f7ddcf3d60c17b0159458c1e6a54.webm?t=1733135420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> is a trippy first-person arcade game with spatial puzzles, and a synthwave soul. You find yourself in a digital world that twists and changes around you, challenging your senses, focus, and reflexes. Interface with the great mystery and transcend.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455920/extras/0c7558e2d1b6162cc32f79db10bb7abc.poster.avif?t=1733135420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455920/extras/0c7558e2d1b6162cc32f79db10bb7abc.webm?t=1733135420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455920/extras/0c7558e2d1b6162cc32f79db10bb7abc.mp4?t=1733135420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore and solve over 20 stages, increasing in size and difficulty<br></li><li>Control your own movement and shift the world around you<br></li><li>Solve puzzles, see through illusions, and master challenging obstacle courses<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in the electronic pulse of the game's OST</li></ul><br>Experience. Question. Interface.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455920/extras/5966f7ddcf3d60c17b0159458c1e6a54.poster.avif?t=1733135420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455920/extras/5966f7ddcf3d60c17b0159458c1e6a54.webm?t=1733135420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> is a trippy first-person arcade game with spatial puzzles, and a synthwave soul. You find yourself in a digital world that twists and changes around you, challenging your senses, focus, and reflexes. Interface with the great mystery and transcend.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455920/extras/0c7558e2d1b6162cc32f79db10bb7abc.poster.avif?t=1733135420\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455920/extras/0c7558e2d1b6162cc32f79db10bb7abc.webm?t=1733135420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455920/extras/0c7558e2d1b6162cc32f79db10bb7abc.mp4?t=1733135420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore and solve over 20 stages, increasing in size and difficulty<br></li><li>Control your own movement and shift the world around you<br></li><li>Solve puzzles, see through illusions, and master challenging obstacle courses<br></li><li>Immerse yourself in the electronic pulse of the game's OST</li></ul><br>Experience. Question. Interface.",
